  "question": {
    "text": "The domain of the function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></msqrt></math> is",
